{"id":"Wb2206f8a4ac0e4dadd7c088d","zh":"时-空随机性","en":"","name":"时-空随机性","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":"C08d5d2b24c7f4d5dfbce","families":[],"definition_zh":"系统或激励在时间和空间维度上的随机变化特性。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"在车辆—轨道系统激振源分析中，用于同时描述沿线路的随机分布与统计谱随时间的随机波动，区分空间分布的随机性和谱统计特征随时间的变化。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wb2206f8a4ac0e4dadd7c088d","text":"时-空随机性","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sfa3933b7e26c6d3149e3","source_id":"P114","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文以轨道随机不平顺的时-空随机性为基础, 阐述其随机反演方法;结合车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型 [1],分析时-空随机不平顺输入下此系统构架蛇形波的随机分布特性及模拟方法;进一步建立车辆-轨道动力计算模型,以构架蛇形波谱的随机反演样本为激振源,通过两种激振源在两种计算模型下的动力响应,相互验证此系统两种激振源的概率转换关系及合理性。","citations":[{"source_id":"P114","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P114":{"id":"P114","title":"车辆-轨道系统激振源随机分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.04.017","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-random-analysis-on-vibration-sources-of-train-track-system"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"指沿线路的随机分布与统计谱随时间的随机波动。","language":"zh","source_id":"P114","paper_slug":"2018-random-analysis-on-vibration-sources-of-train-track-system","title":"车辆－轨道系统激振源随机分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W9753d9f8d8a98133ed360922","name":"temporal-spatial randomness","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W9753d9f8d8a98133ed360922","name":"temporal-spatial randomness","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W9753d9f8d8a98133ed360922","name":"temporal-spatial randomness","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P114","